<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Create Alumni Account | AlumniConnect</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head>
<body><header><h1>Alumni Management System</h1></header><nav class="navbar"><div class="logo"><h3>AlumniConnect</h3></div><ul class="nav-links"><li><a href="/admin">Dashboard</a></li><li><a href="/admin/users/new">Create Alumni</a></li><li><form method="POST" action="/logout"><button type="submit" class="nav-button">Log out</button></form></li></ul></nav>
<main><div class="container form-container"><p class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION</p><h2>Create Alumni Account</h2><p>After creating the account, the system will email the login credentials to the alumnus. Configure SMTP in .env first.</p><% if (error) { %><p class="error-message"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<form method="POST" action="/admin/users"><h3>Login Information</h3><label for="full_name">Full Name *</label><input id="full_name" name="full_name" type="text" maxlength="120" value="<%= full_name %>" required><label for="email">Email Address *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" value="<%= email %>" required><label for="password">Initial Password *</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" minlength="8" required><p class="muted">Use at least 8 characters. The initial password will be sent to the alumni email address. Avoid reusing a personal password.</p><button type="submit">Create Account</button><a class="btn secondary-btn" href="/admin">Cancel</a></form></div></main><footer><p>Alumni Management System &copy; 2026</p></footer></body></html>
